    "asrReferenceTranscript": "Although I agree that..., I also think",
    "grammarExplanationEn": "\"Although I agree that it's important, I also think we should be cautious\" uses 'although' to introduce a concession clause, followed by the main clause with 'also' adding a further, cautionary opinion using the modal 'should'."
  },
